# Wingfall Mire's acid bog (CIPlay vi_wingfall_mire_acid, 11-12 w16 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'; vehicle island, no
# quest). The bog runs from 8 26 to 24 18 (floor -0.6 m, stepped slopes up to the banks); acid zones wm_bogA-D (r 2 at
# -0.4: 18.86 20.57, 13.14 23.43, 22.08 18.96, 9.92 25.04, safe=suit); planks across from 13.3 16.65 to 18.7 27.4 (deck
# ~2.7 m, centre line 1.2 m from the nearest zone's edge). The planks: unhurt; the cargo locker (19.6 29) on the far
# side; wade into zone A from the far side: hurt; walk out up the far slope. Offset under 0.5 m: none.
# (11-17 w16: rewritten for the stepped bog and the higher planks)
island Wingfall Mire keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
